class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Endings per Main Hero Path (3-4 per Hero)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NewGame+</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On Map Encounters (Random Encounters only on World Map)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle Row Combat Strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elemental Magic System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Area of Effect attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Row swapping</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Party swapping</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon swapping</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multi Party Dungeons </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini-Games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timed Inputs (Optional)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 20hrs Gameplay</p></li></ul>",
